$$ Sum \ for \ remaining \ three = a+(a+3)+(a+4) $$ 
Substituting values:


$$ = Sum\ of\ Three =48+(48+3)+(48+4) $$
=>  $$(Sum \of \Three)=48+51+52 \quad\boxed{{151}}$.$$

Therefore, we arrive at:
The required sum calculated as $151.$

